---
/*
  #specs — delivery standards.

  NOTE: `.spec-grid` / `.spec-card` also exist in the service-page system with
  a different visual design. These styles are component-scoped and the two
  systems are never loaded together, so the names cannot collide.
*/
---

<section id="specs" class="wrap">
  <div class="eyebrow">Standards</div>
  <h2>What every delivery looks like.</h2>
  <div class="spec-grid">
    <div class="spec-card">
      <h3>Technical specifications</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><span><span class="spec-key">Audio:</span> WAV, 16 kHz (48 kHz studio option), mono, 16-bit PCM</span></li>
        <li><span><span class="spec-key">Video:</span> MP4 / MOV, 720p–1080p, to brief</span></li>
        <li><span><span class="spec-key">Image:</span> JPEG / PNG, resolution and variation to brief</span></li>
        <li><span><span class="spec-key">Transcripts:</span> verbatim, time-aligned; JSON / TXT / CSV; Yorùbá with full tonal diacritics (Unicode NFC)</span></li>
        <li><span><span class="spec-key">Metadata:</span> contributor age band, gender, region, first language, device, environment</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="spec-card">
      <h3>Quality assurance</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Native-speaker linguists review 100% of transcriptions</li>
        <li>Inter-annotator agreement ≥ 80%, reported per batch</li>
        <li>Audio QC: SNR screening, clipping &amp; duplicate detection</li>
        <li>Free re-delivery on any batch failing agreed QA thresholds (up to two re-deliveries per batch)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="spec-card">
      <h3>Delivery &amp; SLA</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Client-specified secure transfer (AWS S3 bucket, GCP, SFTP, or equivalent); Filen.io or Proton Drive available where the buyer does not provide an approved destination</li>
        <li>Catalog licensing: delivery within 5 business days of agreement</li>
        <li>Commissioned work: agreed milestone schedule, weekly progress reporting</li>
        <li>Accuracy commitments defined in each statement of work</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="spec-card">
      <h3>Licensing</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Exclusive or non-exclusive commercial licenses</li>
        <li>Rights cover commercial use, sublicensing, and AI/ML training</li>
        <li>Custom terms for enterprise and consortium buyers</li>
        <li>Full documentation pack accompanies every license</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .spec-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px }
  .spec-card {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-top: 4px solid var(--green);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 24px;
  }
  .spec-card ul { list-style: none }
  .spec-card li {
    padding: 9px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--line);
    font-size: .93rem;
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .spec-card li:last-child { border-bottom: none }
  .spec-card li::before { content: "▸"; color: var(--green); font-weight: 700 }
  .spec-key { font-family: var(--mono); color: var(--green-deep) }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .spec-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr }
  }
</style>
